#### Cloudinary Module

Used for storing party logos and candidate photos as CDN URLs instead of in the database or local disk.

- `cloudinary.provider.ts` — configures the SDK with `CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME`, `CLOUDINARY_API_KEY`, `CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET` from `.env`
- `cloudinary.service.ts` — accepts a `Buffer`, streams it to Cloudinary, returns the CDN URL
- Any module that needs uploads imports `CloudinaryModule`

