## 6. Security Summary

| Concern | Solution |
|---|---|
| Password storage | `bcrypt` with salt rounds = 10 |
| Token security | JWT in HTTP-only cookies (not localStorage) |
| Token expiry | 1 day |
| Route protection | `JwtAuthGuard` on every non-public route |
| Role enforcement | `RolesGuard` + `@Roles()` decorator |
| Double voting | DB `@Unique` constraint + service-level check |
| Constituency rule | Enforced in `VotesService` before insert |
| Input validation | Global `ValidationPipe` with `whitelist: true` (strips extra fields) |
| CORS | Restricted to `http://localhost:5173` only |
| Secrets | Loaded from `.env`, never hardcoded (except fallback JWT secret in dev) |

